VENDORED PATHS
--------------

All entries below were copied on 2026-09-10 from the OpenCode checkout at
commit 1ead9e3d7f.

1. src/tui/vendor/theme.ts
   Copied from: packages/tui/src/theme/index.ts
   Date: 2026-09-10
   Local modifications:
     - Theme assets are imported as `.ts` modules rather than via JSON
       import-attributes.
     - The upstream set of 33 themes is pruned to 25 (see THEME ASSETS and
       DROPPED THEMES below).
     - OpenCode's runtime theme-management surface is removed: plugin/custom
       themes, subscription, and the allThemes / isTheme / addTheme /
       upsertTheme / hasTheme / setCustomThemes / setSystemTheme functions.
     - The syntax-rule list is trimmed to a representative subset.
   Faithful (unchanged) parts: the pure computation is otherwise carried over
     unchanged -- the Theme type, the resolver, ANSI-to-RGBA conversion,
     generateSystem, and generateSyntax.

2. src/tui/vendor/themes/*.ts   (25 files)
   Copied from: packages/tui/src/theme/assets/<name>.json
   Date: 2026-09-10
   Local modifications: none to the palette values. Each theme is vendored
     unmodified as data. The only change is form: an upstream `<name>.json`
     asset becomes a `<name>.ts` module, and upstream hyphenated filenames
     become underscored filenames (e.g. catppuccin-frappe.json ->
     catppuccin_frappe.ts, one-dark.json -> one_dark.ts,
     osaka-jade.json -> osaka_jade.ts). The full mapping is under THEME ASSETS.

3. src/tui/vendor/dialog.tsx
   Copied from: packages/tui/src/ui/dialog.tsx
   Date: 2026-09-10
   Local modifications:
     - Dropped the toast / clipboard copy-on-select handlers.
     - Dropped the OPENCODE_EXPERIMENTAL flag branches.
     - Dropped the useOpencodeModeStack("modal") push; modal gating is now an
       `enabled` accessor instead.
   Kept: the backdrop plus centred panel, the dialog stack, focus
     save/restore, and Escape / Ctrl+C dismissal.

4. src/tui/vendor/context-helper.tsx
   Copied from: packages/tui/src/context/helper.tsx
