company's product inside a competing tool raises a naming question (ADR 0018):
  cursor    (cursor.json)
  vercel    (vercel.json)
  github    (github.json)
  material  (material.json)   -- also warranted an individual licence check
  monokai   (monokai.json)    -- also warranted an individual licence check

Dropped as OpenCode-branded (the "three extra" drops):
  opencode     (opencode.json)
  orng         (orng.json)
  lucent-orng  (lucent-orng.json)

33 upstream themes - 8 dropped = 25 vendored.
